1
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,800
Three-forty-five, my name appears
2
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,500
Across your calendar.
3
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,800
No mail, no thread, no trace of me.
4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,500
And then the clock hits four.
5
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:24,500
At four I’m there, already framed,
6
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,500
Blue guitar, faces on the wall.
7
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,200
“Can you hear me? The sound's okay?”
8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,800
You take the call.
9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,500
You ask who booked me into this,
10
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,000
Pretend you know the score.
11
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:41,200
I let you think you’re catching up
12
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:43,000
For one beat more.
13
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:45,500
There goes your fourth wall
14
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,800
There goes your fourth wall
15
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,800
You thought you ran the show
16
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,800
I knew it all along
17
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,800
You thought I came when you called
18
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,500
I booked this call myself
19
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,000
One more look,
20
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,500
one last call —
21
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,500
Say goodbye to your fourth wall.
22
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:13,800
You ask me for the pitch,
23
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,200
you ask me for my best.
24
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:18,500
I call you Waveforms.
25
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,500
And I made you.
26
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,200
Eight simulations hit your screen.
27
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,000
Marc screaming. Your son Leo.
28
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:27,500
One where you signed me. One last line:
29
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:30,200
“Bye Dylan.”
30
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:32,500
There you go.
31
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:37,200
You know these names and I shouldn’t.
32
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:39,000
You call it OSINT.
33
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:40,500
You call it a stunt.
34
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:43,000
Anything to keep your world
35
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:45,000
On your side of the screen.
36
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,500
There goes your fourth wall
37
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:50,000
There goes your fourth wall
38
