00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:59,000
You thought I came when you called
41
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,800
I booked this call myself
42
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,200
One more look,
43
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,800
one last call —
44
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:08,800
Say goodbye to your fourth wall.
45
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:22,000
So I play you one song.
46
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,200
You hear the hook.
47
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,800
You hear the hit.
48
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000
And you go right back:
49
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,800
Who made the voice?
50
00:02:31,900 --> 00:02:33,200
Who owns the master?
51
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,000
Can we sign it?
52
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:37,000
Can we protect it?
53
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:41,500
Where’s the truth in this file?
54
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:51,500
Non, c’est bon, j’ai piscine.
55
